WEBVTT

00:05:01.590 --> 00:05:07.548
(Video) Narator: Cjevousni šišmiš.

00:05:10.536 --> 00:05:12.877
Jezerce slasnog nektara

00:05:12.877 --> 00:05:15.042
leži na dnu svake duboke, uske cvjetne glavice.

00:05:15.042 --> 00:05:19.887
Ali kako do njega?

00:05:19.887 --> 00:05:25.083
Nužda je majka evolucije.

00:05:25.083 --> 00:05:48.489
(Glazba)